WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.979 --> 00:00:06.040
Hey korra nation it's Charlie and Nick just
posted an official trailer for the Legend

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.260
of Korra so I'm going to do a full breakdown
of that.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.339
A lot of you sent me links for the leaked
episodes.

00:00:11.339 --> 00:00:15.030
I'm not going to repost them so please don't
post any pirate links in the comments.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:19.410
I will explain why the leak happened and do
some non-spoilery commentary on the episodes.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:23.019
I'm not going to review them, just because
it wouldn't be fair given the video quality

00:00:23.019 --> 00:00:27.550
was bad and they were Chilean dubs with english
subs re-translated, so a lot of the dialogue

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.550
was wrong.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.429
It was a whole big thing but I'll explain
after the trailer breakdown.

00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:35.640
If you're finding me for the first time I
do a ton of Korra videos, mostly when episodes

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.640
are airing.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.640
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.969
I'm going to be doing bonus videos on a weekly
basis now that we have our first trailer and

00:00:38.969 --> 00:00:40.620
they'll be airing episodes soon.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.199
Those videos will probably be on Fridays or
Saturdays.

00:00:43.199 --> 00:00:46.800
Here we go, this breakdown will just be shot
for shot through the trailer.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:52.600
There's no dialogue in it, but it's enough
to gage what some of the character relationships

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.600
and locations are.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.050
First off, the new title sequence looks beautiful.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:02.270
We see korra staring at Ba Sing Se, confirming
that the Earth Kingdom is a big part of the

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.270
story.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:07.860
Then we see what looks like a city made of
metal, which makes some sense given that metal

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.670
bending has evolved to a much more sophisticated
art form since Toph started training people.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:13.540
We see Korra training with one of the new
characters, we don't know her name but she's

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:17.880
dressed in Earth Kingdom clothing so she's
might be one of a couple new core members

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:20.150
of Team Avatar.

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:24.840
Shout out for the Sky Bison we saw during
Book 2.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:28.260
Airbending is a much bigger part of Book 3,
so it's only natural that we'd see a giant

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:30.160
herd of sky bison.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:34.310
Speaking of which, here's a better shot at
some of the new airbender disciples which

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:38.830
moves directly to Tenzin surveying an airbender
temple in the distance.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:43.000
We see someone sitting in prison implying
that that long shot was actually tenzin staring

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.400
at an airbender jail.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.420
Or a temple being used as a jail.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:51.000
I think this next shot is just a follow up
on the metal bending city we saw earlier with

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.000
the airships.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.780
Everyone is wearing metal plating and that
tower looks like it's also made of metal.

00:01:55.780 --> 00:02:00.770
Here is where things get interesting, this
is back in republic city as we can see from

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:01.920
Lin's Police Force.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:05.100
That looks like Mako they're trying to arrest.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.520
But why is he on top of a bridge?

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.100
Maybe he jumped off one of Asami's airships.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.670
Otherwise he would have had to climb up there.

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:16.060
So this next shot is a pretty big deal, this
is Bumi stopping a ball of air using airbending.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:20.340
Which yes, doesn't make sense, but what I've
heard is that Harmonic Convergence in Book

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:25.950
2 and the new spiritual balance between realms
make all benders more powerful and turn some

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:29.230
non-benders from bending families into benders.

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:32.379
Like Bumi for instance, normally being the
son of an avatar you'd expect him to be a

00:02:32.379 --> 00:02:38.060
very powerful bender, but because the world
was out of spiritual alignment during Aang's

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.060
time, bending in general was much less prevalent.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:43.660
It's an example of how things from Book 2
will have consequences in Book 3 and 4.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.799
I really like the idea of them paying off
things like that.

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:51.040
Moving along, it looks like where at another
prison in the Water Tribe.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.480
This person looks like she has the same abilities
as Combustion Man.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:58.560
She might be related to him or just have randomly
developed the ability from birth.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:04.719
She definitely looks like she's being held
in prison too.

00:03:04.719 --> 00:03:08.430
This looks like another villain being kept
in a prison, we can't see his face so there

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:10.459
isn't much context yet.

00:03:10.459 --> 00:03:14.560
This looks like the female water bender villain
everyone was talking about earlier this year.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.239
We're seeing different types of benders in
prison, so it looks like the main villains

00:03:18.239 --> 00:03:23.999
will be a group of different benders being
held separately based on their abilities.

00:03:23.999 --> 00:03:27.650
Everybody cheer, because the water bending
twins are back and it looks like they're helping

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:28.999
Tonraq and Zuko, one more cheer.

00:03:28.999 --> 00:03:34.280
We saw Zuko in that leaked trailer a couple
of months ago, so it's not a huge surprise

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.239
that he's in this trailer.

00:03:36.239 --> 00:03:40.310
This is one of the other new recurring characters
that will work with Team Avatar, it looks

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:42.939
like they'll be meeting him when they travel
to Ba Sing Se.

00:03:42.939 --> 00:03:46.519
Here we actually get a better look at the
tattooed man doing those pullups.

00:03:46.519 --> 00:03:50.610
It looks like he's chasing down Mako and Bolin.

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:54.260
It looks like the place there in is directly
on top of a lava flow.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:56.420
Here's a shot of Zuko riding his dragon.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:00.000
This was actually part of the footage in that
old leaked trailer but this is nice and shiny

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.000
HD footage.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.000
More white lotus members chasing one of the
villains down.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.579
This person has a lot of similar features
to Lin Beifong, so it might be a relative.

00:04:05.579 --> 00:04:09.889
Were supposed to meet a lot of Beifong's family
in Book 3.

00:04:09.889 --> 00:04:13.620
This is a much better shot of the earth kingdom
person korra was practicing airbending with.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.870
It looks like she's part of Lin's police force
in republic city.

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:22.700
Here's Kya looking like a badass taking down
this airbender in the distance.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:27.300
I know a lot of you were asking me if she
was going to be in book 3 and now it's confirmed.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.250
And she does way more than just heal people.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:33.140
Asami is looking pretty badass, taking down
someone from the earth kingdom.

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:36.310
Here's some much better context for that airbender
jail I was talking about earlier.

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:39.390
It looks like this guy is one of the villains
that the white lotus is holding.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:45.350
All of you Korsami shippers will go nuts this
season, it looks like Korra and Asami are

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:47.900
going to be spending some quality time together.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:55.600
Here's the first shot of Lin in the trailer,
she's staring at that Metal Bending city.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.060
That might be the academy created by toph
or just a fortress.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.260
Lin is a huge part of book 3 and I'm super
excited to learn more about her past.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:01.260
Spirit form Jinora.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:05.710
It looks like she's using the spirit world
as a way to investigate an underground cave.

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:12.210
This is the first shot we've seen of Opal,
the Earth Queen, she is the daughter of the

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:16.140
earth king from last airbender and it looks
like she might not be super best friends with

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:19.540
team avatar even if she's not part of the
villains.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.950
Bad things always seem to happen to avatars
who go to Ba Sing Se.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:27.600
This actually looks like people training in
the metal bending academy.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:32.080
Here's Bolin running from that earlier explosion.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:36.590
A lot of these trailer scenes are just taken
from the same moments and spread out in this

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:39.470
trailer.

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:45.670
Here's that airbender villain that Kya was
yanking out of the air with her waterbending.

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:50.650
Zuko looks like he's working with the white
lotus and it's probably something to do with

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:53.820
all these villains in the different jails.

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:54.820
Metal Bending Korra for the win.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:56.970
I can't remember the last time I saw her metalbend.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:03.830
Here we see that the Dai Li are back and capturing
Jinora, despite the fact the Earth King disbanded

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.100
them during Last Airbender.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.260
Here's that new airbender character again.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:11.450
He looks like he might have a fun time with
team avatar when they first meet.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:16.300
Kind of like when we first met toph as a child
and she was't the friendliest person.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:20.720
This is one of my favorite shots in the trailer,
Korra is using her airbending to sail a desert

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:23.220
ship away from the Jaws of Sand Sharks.

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:28.130
Beifong in training, there isn't a lot of
context, but there's got to be something happening

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:30.210
in the earth kingdom that's going to bring
her back.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:33.610
I'm guessing that will be part of the Dai
Li plot and the white lotus villain plot will

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:35.400
be a totally different story.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:39.530
This is mako fighting that evil waterbender,
there's some scenes from later in the trailer

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:40.530
too.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:46.070
Here's the first real shot of a spirit whale
floating around in the physical realm.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:49.550
Remember at the end of last season, spirits
started to come back into the physical realm,

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.770
but this is the first shot of one in the trailer.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:56.950
So here the action just builds into a series
of different fight scenes all with that group

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:00.630
of villains the white lotus and zuko were
trying to deal with.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:04.430
This final shot is just a callback to all
the spirit vines growing in republic city

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:05.450
last year.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:10.630
And that's it, just for reference about 50%
of that footage was what was in those leaked

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.630
episodes.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:12.630
So it was really cool of them to release more
new stuff.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.540
Not just recycle the leaked footage.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:18.690
The picture it generally paints is that there
will be a team of villains made up of different

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:21.590
types of benders that the white lotus and
Zuko will be dealing with.

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:25.400
That will probably be the main threat, then
there's the earth kingdom plot, the earth

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.400
queen and the Dai Li.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:30.630
That will probably be the B story, the one
that will feature Beifong, Jinora and the

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.240
other side characters.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:36.290
The didn't add a release date for the episodes
in the trailer, but the first book 2 trailer

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.920
came about two months before the book 2 premiere.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:42.650
So this could mean Nick is going to start
airing episodes in august.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:46.470
The other possibility is that because of the
leak, they'll air them starting in July.

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:48.830
We'll have to wait and see.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:50.950
Until episodes start airing, I'll just be
doing weekly bonus videos.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:56.360
But when episodes get here I'll do review
videos and Q&amp;As.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:57.770
So about the leak, here's what happened.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:08:01.730
You probably heard that the episodes were
posted by Mundo Nick on their website.

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.790
That's the mexico office for nickelodeon.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:08.030
Because most people think of tv shows in terms
of seasons, they got confused because Nick

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:11.150
uses Books to denote different seasons of
Korra.

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:16.390
So they were posting book 2 episodes on their
website and mistakenly posted 4 episodes of

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:17.550
Book 3.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:20.340
They were up for almost an entire day before
they got taken down.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:22.420
They were actually chilean dubs, not spanish.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:25.000
Which is kind of weird, but whatever.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:33.450
The quality of the animation this season looks
amazing compared to Book 2, Studio Miir did

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:45.170
all the episodes, but the story plotting and
character development is much much better

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.500
than book 2, so I think overall.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.829
these new episodes will be the best Korra
you guys have ever seen.

00:08:50.829 --> 00:08:56.040
Now it's your turn though, let me know what
you thought of the trailer and what your theories

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.470
are about the new villains.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:01.259
The cool thing is that because book 3 and
book 4 were ordered at the same time, there's

00:09:01.259 --> 00:09:04.120
a good chance that the main villains will
be part of both.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:08.620
So the story will just carry over.

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:10.899
My next Korra video will just be a Q&amp;A, I'll
post that tomorrow.

00:09:10.899 --> 00:09:12.540
So add all your questions in the comments.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.829
Right now click here to get it.

00:09:13.829 --> 00:09:16.790
I'll add the annotation as soon as I post
it.

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.910
And click here to learn about the new star
wars villain.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:22.130
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

